    "family_reading": {
        "text": "Rekaai Reka is a small open weights line, with both listed versions supporting reasoning and publishing their weights. Context windows run from 16384 to 65536 tokens, and the two versions differ sharply here: Reka Flash 3 offers 65536 tokens of context and up to 58982 output tokens, while Reka Edge, the newer release, is capped at 16384 tokens of context and 14745 output tokens. Both accept image, text and video input and return text. Pricing is low, at $0.1 per million input tokens for both, with output at $0.1 for Reka Edge and $0.2 for Reka Flash 3. The facts suggest the family suits multimodal work where open weights and low cost matter, but long documents and large outputs are limited, especially on the newer Reka Edge, and no benchmark rows are given to judge quality.",
